<title>USA: CCB Financial Corp completes merger.</title>
<headline>CCB Financial Corp completes merger.</headline>
<dateline>DURHAM, N.C. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>CCB Financial Corp said on Friday that  it had completed its merger with American Federal Bank FSB for $410.3  million, a pricetag significantly higher than the transaction's original  estimated value of $325 million as announced in February.</p>
<p>Effective with the opening of business on August 1, American Federal  will continue to operate under its own name as a wholly owned subsidiary  of CCB in South Carolina, CCB said in a statement.</p>
</text>
